<title>USA: Southbridge, Mass., won by  Prudential.</title>
<headline>Southbridge, Mass., won by  Prudential.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities Inc. said it won $3.375 million of Southbridge, Mass., general obligation limited tax bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.447 percent.</p>
</text>
